  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Programme Funded Refugee Adviser monitoring DFID-funded UNHCR/WFP delivery and also placed with European Community Humanitarian Office to strengthen donor programme and policy coordination regarding refugees is a component of Support for Refugees in Kenya (2012-2016) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;160,998. It works in the following sector(s): Material relief assistance and services.</narrative>
  </description>
